        351.3483581542969
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "where Equation (11) follows from the line preceding it because if J˜π(x, 0) ≥−ˆq, then certainly",
      "bbox": [
        90.0,
        371.8631896972656,
        521.9966430664062,
        383.2272033691406
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "J˜π(x, 0) > 0. This coverage property result is precisely the same as described in Remark 4. Fur-",
      "bbox": [
        90.0,
        386.0231018066406,
        522.0025634765625,
        396.7762145996094
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "thermore, Section 3.2 in Angelopoulos and Bates (2023) yields:",
      "bbox": [
        90.00000762939453,
